{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-05_beg","storyGroup":"main_16","storySort":241,"storyDependence":"main_16_level_main_16-05_beg","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"16-5","storyName":"分水岭线","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"博士和Mon3tr从自杀未遂的研究员科谢尼娅口中得知疑似有内卫被杀的消息。一行人重新制定了行动计划，决定兵分两路。几天前，矿工们利用芯片设下埋伏，袭击了纠察队。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_main_16-05_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"main_16-04","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":4,"next":6,"characters":["Mon3tr","科谢尼娅","Mantra","阿米娅","阿洛伊泽","靠近的声音","极境","激动的纠察队队员","疑惑的纠察队队员","散漫的纠察队队员","纠察队队长","雷尔金"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"dialog","id":8},{"type":"animtext","id":9,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_heavy","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>乌萨斯，远北中心矿区研究所</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":10},{"type":"animtextclean","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":12},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":13,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":15},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"她刚刚......是不是说了“内卫”？","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":20},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"22","text":"我听到她说的是......"},"2":{"id":"22","text":" 杀死内卫。"}},"values":[],"id":21},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":22,"end":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"她的意思是......这种叫“奥卡”的物质，杀死了内卫？","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"这可能吗？难道这是某种比“国度”更恐怖的邪魔产物？","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-5$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":27},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"29","text":"一种从矿井中发现的未知物质。"},"2":{"id":"29","text":" 研究所用它分别在感染者和非感染者身上做了实验。"}},"values":[],"id":28},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":29},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"31","text":"实验结果显示，它会使感染者的病情加重。"}},"values":[],"id":30},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":31,"end":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"也许，这是这里的研究员对某种物质的特殊称呼，在见到实物之前，我们都没法下定论。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"科谢尼娅，科谢尼娅！看着我，你还能想起些什么吗？","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"我......你是......","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":38},{"type":"text","text":"Mon3tr以为这次呼唤会与之前一样毫无收获，但女人迷蒙的双眼却忽地睁大了。","id":39},{"type":"text","text":"紧接着，她反手死死抓住眼前人的衣服，把Mon3tr拽到身前。","id":40},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#6$2","focus":"l","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"你是——您是所长？凯尔希所长？","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"是您来接我了吗？我想回去，我还想见到老师——","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#7$2","focus":"l","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"我想见伊利亚老师......还有柳达......呜......","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"但他们......他们还会想见我吗？我这样懦弱，什么也做不到......我还配见到他们吗？","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"呜......呜呜——啊！！！","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"我......我——","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":51},{"type":"text","text":"然而没等Mon3tr作出回应，女人又兀自放手，跌坐回去。","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#8$2","focus":"l","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"不，不对......","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"你不是凯尔希所长。我再也没见到过她，就像我再也没见到过其他人。她不该在这里。","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"我甚至见过她后来的同伴，他们......他们......","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"你见过？你见过谁？是不是一位个子小小的、总是面带微笑的黎博利？","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"黎博利......是啊，我见过她。","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"她去哪儿了？","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"我不知道......","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"那群杀死内卫的人......那些感染者，她之前和那些人在一起。","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"他们会死！所有人都会死！","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#7$2","focus":"l","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"呜......我不知道——我不知道......","id":68,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":70},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"72","text":"她需要镇静剂。"},"2":{"id":"72","text":" 她有脱水症状。"}},"values":[],"id":71},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":72,"end":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"那这些信息——","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-1$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":75},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":76},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"78","text":"矿工出逃与内卫有关。"},"2":{"id":"78","text":" Mantra说过内卫造成的污染在向南蔓延。"}},"values":[],"id":77},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":78},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"80","text":"答案已经很明显了。"}},"values":[],"id":79},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":80,"end":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"可是，内卫真的被杀了吗？被一群矿工？这有可能吗？","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-5$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":84},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"86","text":"或许我们应该考虑......"},"2":{"id":"86","text":" 如果这是真的，那将意味着什么。"}},"values":[],"id":85},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":86,"end":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"那位女大公封锁矿区的真正目的，是为了隐藏有个内卫死在了她的辖区的事实？","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"但这不可能！无论是皇帝还是集团军，都不会善罢甘休的，如果她真的想要掩盖这件事，一开始就不会答应让我们进入矿区。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"还有那位近卫军，她知道这件事吗？","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-4$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":94},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"96","text":"没错......"},"2":{"id":"96","text":" 这些正是我们需要担心的事。"}},"values":[],"id":95},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":96},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"98","text":"先通知Mantra和阿米娅吧。"}},"values":[],"id":97},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":98,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":99},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":100},{"type":"charslot","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":102},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":103},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","id":104},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"收到，博士。","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"我们这里同样有些发现，与你们得到的情报相符。","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"有打斗痕迹的场所，遗落了一些医疗用品。","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"是罗德岛的制式。","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"我们马上与你们会合。","id":110},{"type":"dialog","id":111},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":112},{"type":"charslot","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$1","id":114},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_bg_bg_Morgue.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":115},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","id":116},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"明白......博士。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"我们马上就到。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#4$1","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"怎么了？你的同伴那边有什么发现？","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$1","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"恐怕需要我们会合后才能说明。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"阿洛伊泽小姐，这里还有什么需要注意的线索吗？","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#10$1","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"我所知有限，得不出什么更有效的信息，有必要的话，一会让那位博士亲自来查看一下也无妨。","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"不过这倒是更加让我确信了军方毫无底线这件事......","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$1","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"阿洛伊泽小姐，我想问，对于发生在矿区的事，您还知道什么吗？","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#4$1","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"嗯？你是想问什么？这座研究所里的实验还是发生变异的感染者？","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#10$1","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"......怎么了？","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$1","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"......","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#10$1","id":136},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crystalmagic_loop","id":137},{"type":"text","text":"阿米娅向来抗拒在这样的情况下，以这种方式使用自己的能力，但她仍旧尝试着去触碰了眼前这位近卫军的思绪。","id":138},{"type":"text","text":"阿洛伊泽的心头满是阴霾和疑惑，却并未掺杂心虚。","id":139},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$1","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"没什么，我们走吧。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":142},{"type":"dialog","id":143},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":144},{"type":"charslot","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":146},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":147},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":149},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":150,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"博士，这些资料......还有遗书，该怎么办？","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":154},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"156","text":"这份遗书没有提及太多与石棺有关的内容。"},"2":{"id":"156","text":" 那位近卫军提供了不少情报，我们也该适当地回报。"}},"values":[],"id":155},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":156,"end":161},{"type":"charslot","id":157},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","id":158},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfootstep","delay":"0.3","volume":"0.5","channel":"2","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"靠近的声音","text":"是在这边吗？还真是难找......","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"靠近的声音","text":"果然，藏得这么深，一定有秘密——","id":161,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":162},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":164},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#10$1","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"——等等，这是谁？","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#2$2","id":168},{"type":"text","text":"近卫军的目光投向斜靠在墙边，面色苍白，双目紧闭的女人。","id":169},{"type":"charslot","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"一个没有撤离的研究员，科谢尼娅。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"研究所与流动医疗队可能有往来，我们想问她我们那些同伴的去向，但她精神恍惚，脱水严重，不宜继续接受询问。","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#4$1","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"那地上这些蜡烛和线路又是......？","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$1","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"......我猜，这是她为自我了断所做的准备。博士，这里到底发生了什么？","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":179},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"181","text":"我们及时赶到，阻止了爆炸发生。"},"2":{"id":"181","text":" 情况很复杂。"}},"values":[],"id":180},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":181,"end":184},{"type":"charslot","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#4$1","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"你手上拿着的那些文件是什么？","id":184,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":186},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"188","text":"遗书，你也看看吧。"},"2":{"id":"188","text":" （递给她）"}},"values":[],"id":187},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":188,"end":203},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#4$1","id":190},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"......一事无成的研究员，名叫“奥卡”的神秘物质......人体实验。","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"看上去，我们在下面见到的那些死者，是被这个“奥卡”杀死的。","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_401_elysm_na_1#6","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"这里真的在做人体实验？","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_char_401_elysm_na_6.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_401_elysm_na_1#7","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"该死，我当时只是一说——","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_char_401_elysm_na_7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#2$1","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"（摇头）","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#5$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"哼，看来女大公果真隐瞒了很多东西。","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"但是这个实验的目的是什么？这里的研究员会使用这种卑劣的手段，我并不意外，但他们总该有所图才是！","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"这位研究员本人呢？她什么也没说吗？","id":203,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":205},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"207","text":"看上去有些研究资料已经被人为销毁了。"},"2":{"id":"207","text":" 但不确定是矿工还是这里的研究员自己所为。"}},"values":[],"id":206},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":207,"end":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#4$1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"所以，我们还是不知道那些变异感染者诞生的原因。","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"不过，起码现在我们知道这里还有活下来的矿工逃走了，除开这位研究员，那些逃走的矿工很可能就是整件事的唯一切入点了。","id":210,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":212},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"214","text":"那些感染者矿工在洗劫了研究所后离开了。"},"2":{"id":"214","text":" 他们往南去了，这是唯一的线索。"}},"values":[],"id":213},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":214,"end":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#4$1","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"我们该抓紧时间了......这位研究员恢复到可以接受询问的状态还需要多久？","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"很难预估。她脱水严重，刚见面时精神状况也很糟糕，我们得先为她治疗。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#4$1","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"真麻烦......","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"我们还不清楚矿工已经出逃了多久，既然知道了方向，就必须抓紧时间追上去。","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"可我们不可能带着没有行动能力的伤员上路。","id":222,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":224},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"226","text":"我和Mon3tr留下看顾科谢尼娅。"},"2":{"id":"226","text":" 你们去追踪离开的矿工队伍。"}},"values":[],"id":225},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":226,"end":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#10$1","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"呃......你们确定要单独留在这里？","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"虽然这是你们的自由，但我还是有必要提醒你们。","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"现在没人知道远北这些矿区都处于什么样的状态，同样也没人能保障你们的安全。","id":230,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":232},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"234","text":"我们有能力保护好自己的安全。"}},"values":[],"id":233},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":234},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"236","text":"你们可以相信阿米娅的指挥。"}},"values":[],"id":235},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":236,"end":239},{"type":"charslot","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#5$1","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"博士？","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-5$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":241},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"243","text":"你可以的，阿米娅。"},"2":{"id":"243","text":" 相信你自己的判断。"}},"values":[],"id":242},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":243,"end":247},{"type":"charslot","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"我会和阿米娅一起。","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"博士，希望你们顺利。","id":247,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":249},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"251","text":"等科谢尼娅恢复行动能力，我们就去找你们会合。"},"2":{"id":"251","text":" 离开污染区之后，通讯应该会逐渐恢复。"}},"values":[],"id":250},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":251,"end":261},{"type":"charslot","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#4$1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"那就这样。","id":254},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$1","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"博士，如果通讯一直没有恢复，那我们找到那群矿工之后就回研究所和你们会合。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"（点头）","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#4$1","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿洛伊泽","text":"行，后备计划也有了，我们赶紧出发。","id":260},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":261,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":263},{"type":"charslot","id":264},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":265},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_bg_bg_battlefield.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":266},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":267},{"type":"animtext","id":268,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>乌萨斯远北中心矿区</><p=2>三天前</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":269},{"type":"animtextclean","id":270},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":271},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_truckengine","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":272},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.8","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":273},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":274},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"1","id":275},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":276},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$escape_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_dia_escape_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":277,"musicid":2},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的纠察队队员","text":"就在这边......快过来！","id":278},{"type":"dialog","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_082","duration":"0.5","id":280},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的纠察队队员","text":"哎，你跑什么！这破定位时灵时不灵的，指不定根本就不在这儿。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的纠察队队员","text":"上次有个矿场的驮兽为了找草吃跑出了界，愣是让它跑了十多里路这东西才往岗哨发送信号，谁知道这次是不是也是一样的情况？","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":284},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_082","duration":"1","id":286},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_082","focus":"r","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"散漫的纠察队队员","text":"按理说这些人不该出现在南出口周围，这条路早就封了——","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_082","focus":"l","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的纠察队队员","text":"嗯？你怎么会从那边过来？","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的纠察队队员","text":"不对，你不是我们队的吧，你在这儿做什么？","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_082","focus":"r","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"散漫的纠察队队员","text":"我还想问你呢。这儿不在你们队的管辖范围内吧？","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_082","focus":"l","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的纠察队队员","text":"现在早就不兴那套辖区不辖区的东西了，谁先接到消息，先找到逃跑的感染者，那功劳就是谁的。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的纠察队队员","text":"让开，别挡道。","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_082","focus":"r","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"散漫的纠察队队员","text":"照你的说法，是我们先来的，那这功劳理应是我们的。","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_082","focus":"l","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的纠察队队员","text":"谁找到就*乌萨斯粗口*算谁的。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":302},{"type":"dialog","id":303},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_082","duration":"1","id":305},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纠察队队长","text":"托夏，干什么呢？别跟他废话，找人要紧。","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的纠察队队员","text":"在这边！他们都躲在——哈哈哈哈啊哈哈！","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_082","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的纠察队队员","text":"他发现什么了笑成这样？","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_082","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纠察队队长","text":"走，去看看。","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":314},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":315},{"type":"charslot","id":316},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的纠察队队员","text":"前面有个不深不浅的洞，那几个矿工就躲在里面，还以为我们发现不了——","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的纠察队队员","text":"天哪，哈哈哈哈哈啊哈哈......这太好笑了。","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_082","focus":"l","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纠察队队长","text":"哼。他们以为那是什么，战壕吗？","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纠察队队长","text":"托夏，戈沙，带上所有人，你们赶紧去把那些驮兽不如的蠢货给我弄出来。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_082","duration":"0.5","id":324},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_082","focus":"r","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"散漫的纠察队队员","text":"从定位上看，这些逃窜的感染者矿工数量还不少呢，需要帮忙吗？","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_082","focus":"l","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纠察队队长","text":"你们队有多少人？","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_082","focus":"r","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"散漫的纠察队队员","text":"不多，算上我也就六个人。","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_082","focus":"l","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纠察队队长","text":"太多了。","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_082","focus":"r","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"散漫的纠察队队员","text":"随你怎么说。咱们是这附近仅剩的两支空闲队伍，而且是我们先到的这里。","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"散漫的纠察队队员","text":"这碗羹，你们不分也得分。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":337},{"type":"charslot","id":338},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":339},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.95","duration":"0","name":"avg_npc_082","afrom":"0","ato":"0","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.95","duration":"0","name":"avg_npc_082","afrom":"0","ato":"0","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","posfrom":"120,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.7","afrom":"0","ato":"1","focus":"m","id":343},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":344},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-120,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.7","afrom":"0","ato":"1","focus":"m","id":345},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":346},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"0.6","id":348},{"type":"charslot","id":349},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_082","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"0.7","id":350},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_082","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","duration":"0.7","id":352},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":353},{"type":"charslot","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_082","focus":"l","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_082","focus":"l","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纠察队队长","text":"......","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_082","focus":"r","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"散漫的纠察队队员","text":"怎么——","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$calamity_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_dia_calamity_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":360,"musicid":3},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":361},{"type":"charslot","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的纠察队队员","text":"——啊！！！","id":363},{"type":"charslot","id":364},{"type":"text","text":"尖叫声打破了两支队伍的对峙。","id":365},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","volume":"0.7","id":366},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":367},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch_xshield","channel":"2","delay":"0.3","id":368},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_riot","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":369},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":370},{"type":"text","text":"紧随其后的，是肢体搏斗、钝器砸碎骨肉的声响。","id":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_082","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纠察队队长","text":"发生什么——","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的纠察队队员","text":"救命！救我！他们都疯了——","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的纠察队队员","text":"这些该死的感染者都*乌萨斯粗口*疯了！","id":376},{"type":"dialog","id":377},{"type":"charslot","id":378},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":379},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#10$1","duration":"1.5","id":381},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"你说得对......","id":383},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#5$1","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"我会让你们见识一下，感染者的愤怒，还有疯狂。","id":385},{"type":"dialog","id":386},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":387},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":388},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":389},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":390},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":391},{"type":"image","id":392},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":393}],"characters":["Mon3tr","科谢尼娅","Mantra","阿米娅","阿洛伊泽","靠近的声音","极境","激动的纠察队队员","疑惑的纠察队队员","散漫的纠察队队员","纠察队队长","雷尔金"]}